Subject: [PATCH 5/8] test(foldkit): budget produced Block composition

produced-composition-8 is the deep composition fixture with every Block
published through produceBlock or produceViewlessBlock and a named
producer. Its ceiling covers the produced shapes and the producer check,
and fails when a producer is written inline. The ceiling is the highest
instantiation count observed across repeated runs, because TypeScript
7.0.2 reports slightly different counts for the same input.
